    "teach_3": {
      "id": "teach_3",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A time ratio is often easier than a difference.\n\nSuppose A:B times = 2:3. Let their times be 2k and 3k. If together they fill in 6 h:\n1/(2k)+1/(3k)=1/6.",
